  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Apoyo para Fortalecer la Integracin de Colombia en las Cadenas Globales de Valor II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Program to Strengthen Colombia&apos;s Integration into Global Value Chains II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de esta serie programtica y su segunda operacin es promover la integracin de Colombia en las cadenas globales de valor (CGV) para impulsar el crecimiento econmico. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) facilitar la atraccin y el establecimiento de Inversin Extranjera Directa (IED) productiva; (ii) facilitar las operaciones de comercio exterior; y (iii) fortalecer las capacidades productivas y exportadoras de las micro, pequeas y medianas empresas (MIPYME).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of this programmatic series and its second phase is to promote Colombia&apos;s integration into global value chains (GVCs) to foster economic growth. The specific objectives are: (i) to facilitate the attraction and establishment of productive Foreign Direct Investment (FDI); (ii) to streamline foreign trade operations; and (iii) to strengthen the productive and export capacities of micro, small, and medium-sized enterprises (MSMEs).</narrative>
  </description>
